Hi, everybody!

This is the most significant update this game has ever had. We have spent the last month redesigning many sprites, including many new concepts, and reprogramming many systems in the game.

This is already part of the final polishing of the game, as we plan to bring it to consoles soon.

I have to admit that it already looks like a finished game. We are very happy.

New features include:
•	New wildlife NPCs;
•	Redrawn wildlife NPCs;
•	Awsome idle animations for the protagonists, according to each one's personality. Tell us which one you like the most!
•	New extinct vegetation sprites to differentiate the Safari Zones;
•	New armors: Hazmat suit C;
•	New items: Antifreeze genes; Antiburning genes;
•	New achievements; 
•	New Chronos Secrets; 
•	New window skins; 
•	We have a new completely reprogrammed bait system. It now works much more similar to the Poke. series, with several types of baits for your strategies. You can also craft these inside the Maintenance Sheds.

Revised systems:
•	Radar system;
•	Coordinate / map system;
•	Crafting system;
•	Bait/taming;
•	Quest log;
•	Boat fast travel;
•	VTOL fast travel;

New system:
•	Canoe fast travel system;

New animals:
